    <description>This flow triggers when ownership of Lead changes to an agent for the first time. We do 2 things here:
1. Track how long Lead was in the Queue before it was assigned to an agent;
2. Automatically move Lead status from New to Nurturing when assigned to an agent


14th May, 2024 - amended with Sales Business Hours (01mPy0000008Oef)</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Lead - Update Time in Queue &amp; Status {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Lead - Update Time in Queue &amp; Status</label>
